# Development conveniences: the geo databases live in a
# hebcal-web checkout, and are symlinked here so the PDF calendars and their
# tests can find them without flags. They are absolute paths on one machine, so
# they must not be committed -- deployments pass -zips-db and
# -geonames-db instead. See README.md.
/geonames.sqlite3
/zips.sqlite3

